From 455f6d93db2a81db0afa3f07c1467087d0dc6a6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakompiled <itsrufer@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:01:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] web: Emscripten build of gk

web/CMakeLists.txt builds only what gk needs. libco runs cothreads on
pthreads, curl/discord-rpc/cubeb are stubbed, and the GOAL call
trampolines stop with a message until goalc can emit wasm.
